WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 009. IT WORKED SOMEWHERE ELSE.. That does not mean it can work here.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
START WITH THE DECISION. WHAT MUST THIS PLACE DECIDE?. Keep the recurring decision gap visible before scoring fit.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
TEST REQUIREMENTS. NETWORK · POWER · ACCESS · SUPPORT. Add hazards, governance, data, maintenance, and community authority.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
EVIDENCE THE PLACE. CAPACITY IS NOT AN ASSUMPTION.. Name the local source, owner, gap, and mitigation.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
BOUND THE PILOT. PILOT · FALLBACK · STOP · AUTHORITY. A high score permits only a controlled local test.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. CHANGE THE PLACE. THE ANSWER SHOULD MOVE.. Transferability is not a property of the technology alone.

